2|//!
3|//! Provides live synchronization between D-Bus objects and gRPC services:
4|//! - D-Bus property changes → gRPC streaming updates
5|//! - gRPC mutations → D-Bus method calls / property sets
6|//! - D-Bus signals → gRPC server-streaming
